{"id": "119925", "name": "אינטגרל לא מסוים של tan(x)/cos²(x)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו, ואל תשכחו את הקבוע</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,d{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> אינטגרציה בחלקים מחזירה את אותו אינטגרל, ופותרים משוואה עבורו.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — אינטגרציה בחלקים</b><br><p>נבצע אינטגרציה בחלקים עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u = {{CT:2}}\\)</span> ו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(dv = {{CT:3}} d{{CT:1}}\\)</span></p><p>אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(du = {{CT:4}} d{{CT:1}}\\)</span> ו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v = {{CT:5}}\\)</span></p><p>נקבל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} &= \\int u dv \\\\&= uv - \\int v du \\\\&= {{CT:2}}{{CT:5}} - \\int {{CT:5}}{{CT:4}}d{{CT:1}} +c \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — פתרון המשוואה</b><br><p>האינטגרל המבוקש מופיע בשני האגפים, ולכן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 2\\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} = {{CT:6}} \\]</p><p>כך ש</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} = \\frac{{CT:7}}{2}+ \\frac{c}{2}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה. יפה מאוד.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nvarss:delete(C,delete(c,varss));\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);\n\nstu:ev(diff(an1,v));\ntm:stu-p;\ntmp:is(abs(float(ev(tm,x=1/2)^2+ev(tm,x=1/3)^2))<0.0002);\n\nc1:ev(diff(an1,c));\nc2:ev(diff(an1,C));\nd:c1^2+c2^2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "tmp", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.6, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "d", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.4, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp1", "pp2", "v"], "nvariants": 1}